&lt;li&gt;Implementing authentication and authorization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enforcing organization-level data isolation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Handling payment history without losing transaction records.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managing permissions across server actions and UI components.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Testing application workflows with Playwright.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;These challenges have helped me understand the importance of maintainable architecture and secure data handling.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;


  🚀 What's Next?
